WEBVTT

00:00:03.214 --> 00:00:04.492
<v><b>A:</b></v> I <b>get up</b> at <b>seven</b>.

00:00:06.795 --> 00:00:07.858
I <b>take</b> a <b>shower</b>.

00:00:10.185 --> 00:00:11.217
I <b>go</b> to <b>work</b>.

00:00:13.558 --> 00:00:15.230
I <b>have</b> a <b>sandwich</b> for <b>lunch</b>.

00:00:17.559 --> 00:00:18.996
I <b>get home</b> at <b>six</b>.

00:00:21.430 --> 00:00:22.247
I <b>make dinner</b>.

00:00:24.598 --> 00:00:26.003
I <b>go</b> to <b>bed</b> at <b>ten</b>.

00:00:28.373 --> 00:00:29.214
<b>What</b> a <b>life</b>!